<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Dec kerosene stocks up 33.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Dec kerosene stocks up 33.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's kerosene stockpiles stood at 4.1 million kilolitres (kl) as of the end of December, up 33.2 percent from a year earlier, but down 15.5 percent from a month earlier, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sales of kerosene during the four-month period from November to February account for about 60 percent of the total annual sales in volume terms.</p>
</text>
